OL,3,GNEWSADisabled couple begin board game  
OL,4,Achallenge fundraiser                   
OL,6,FA disabled married couple have taken up
OL,7,Fa challenge to play 80 board games in  
OL,8,Feight consecutive days in support of   
OL,9,Ftheir much-loved local church.         
OL,11,FMarlene and Kevin O'Donnell are        
OL,12,Fcompeting against each other from 21 to
OL,13,F28 November, to raise funds for St     
OL,14,FMichael's in Sonning Common,           
OL,15,FOxfordshire.                           
OL,17,FThe pair said traditional challenges   
OL,18,Fsuch as running marathons were not     
OL,19,F"realistic" for them but hoped their   
OL,20,Fshared love of strategy board games    
OL,21,Fwould "make a real difference".        
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
