OL,3,GNEWSADisabled couple begin board game  
OL,4,Achallenge fundraiser                   
OL,6,FMarlene said they "didn't want to do   
OL,7,Fsomething that is easy", adding: "The  
OL,8,Fgames can take up to two hours to play,
OL,9,Fso it's a big thing and we're both     
OL,10,Fworking [on it]."                      
